# a unit word in a type position is its dimension's class (card unit-fields): fields, variables, parameters
'class R{d: km}; R(1500m).d'	1.5km
'class R{t: min; w: kg}; r = R(50min, 3kg); r.w + 500g'	3.5kg
'min(3, 4)'	3
# a unit field or variable shows its value in its unit, only a quantity of that dimension (decision: no conversion at a write)
'class R{d: km}; r = R(1km); r.d = 500m; r.d'	0.5km
'x: int = 3.7; x'	error
